      "message": "[error] Line 67: 🔴 `merge_binaries()` invokes lipo with command substitution (`$($COMMAND)`), which executes *lipo’s stdout* as a new command instead of executing the lipo command itself. In the normal case this yields an empty command and fails under `set -e`, breaking multi-arch/macOS universal builds. Run lipo directly (e.g. `eval \"$COMMAND\"`, or preferably avoid string-eval and call `lipo -create -output ...` with proper quoting).",
